00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:48.740
That's right.

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:53.200
So we know Rowan is floating around in space, but how do we save him?

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:54.200
I don't know.

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:59.230
Rowan must be in a state of suspended animation, probably in some sort of orbit.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.260
Well, you can bet if we know where Rowan is, so does Tulpa.

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:06.900
Hey, man, no sway. It's no big deal.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:09.780
It's not like they're any better off than we are, right?

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.480
Don't ever say that!

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:12.510
And why?

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:15.860
And never, ever underestimate Tulpa.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.420
