00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:19.730
Yeah, I know.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:24.220
Just hang in there, Rowan. We're coming, man.

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:38.520
Where do we start?

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:39.480
Pa.

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:41.820
You think he's got something up his sleeve?

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:47.240
Course. As long as Rowan is still alive, he's a threat to Tulpa and the Dynasty.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.650
She's right. Tulpa's not going to leave any loose ends.

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:53.450
If there's a way to finish Rowan, he'll do it.

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:54.980
Well, that's true.

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:58.780
But before we go spy on Tulpa, we're going to need to have a plan.

00:02:59.640 --> 00:02:59.880
Plan?

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.490
Man, all we got to do is spring a surprise attack.

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:05.370
No way. You have a short memory, Kento.

00:03:05.710 --> 00:03:08.310
Remember, we've already had our shot at Talpa.

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:10.020
That's old news, dude.

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:12.850
You can bet we'll be ready for him now.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:17.280
We know what we have to do, and we will not fail this time.

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:19.660
Oh, aren't we confident now?

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:23.020
Okay, man. If you got a better idea, come on, let's hear it.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:25.280
Let's just make sure we do this thing right.

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:27.910
Stop! This fighting is getting us nowhere.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:29.960
Listen, Talpa...

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:34.930
evil is very strong. One of you on your own doesn't stand a chance at defeating Talpa,

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:40.710
but together you are all a strong fighting force. I suggest we choose two of you to go

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:45.790
find out what Talpa's next move will be. The rest of us will go back to the city in the morning.

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:53.730
Does everyone agree? Right. That sounds like a good idea, Mia. Count me in. Now we just have

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:58.840
to decide who's gonna go. Right. Come on. Any volunteers? Yeah.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.420
