00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:06.740
No way. Cy and I will go.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:09.960
Hey, but you were against going in the first place, dude.

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:12.940
All you got on your mind right now is a fight.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:16.750
